flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Execute optimization script"]

RunNSGA2["**Run NSGA2 Optimization**<br/>Configure algorithm parameters<br/>pop_size, n_gen, n_replications, base_seed, n_cores"]

CreateProblem["**Create Problem Instance**<br/>Class BufferCapacityProblem<br/>n_var = 6, n_obj = 2<br/>xl {1-10}, xu {1-10}, n_replications, base_seed, n_cores"]

NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Sampling SBX PM operators<br/>Elitism and diversity maintenance"]

Minimize["**Minimize Call**<br/>Start optimization loop<br/>Termination by generation"]

ProblemEvaluate["**Problem._evaluate**<br/>Receive population X<br/>Prepare evaluation tasks for individuals"]

MultiprocPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>processes = n_cores<br/>Map evaluate tasks to workers"]

EvalSingle["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Inputs caps vector and seeds<br/>Run n_replications per candidate<br/>Aggregate avg_wip and avg_throughput as [wip, -throughput]"]

RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Inputs seed and caps<br/>Build simulation environment<br/>Return metrics overall and machine_energy"]

DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap, delay, tokens, store<br/>Methods put, get, free_capacity, in_transit_count"]

MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name, input_buffer, output_buffer, process_time, availability, mttr, working_power, waiting_power, capacity<br/>Methods run, _breakdown_cycle, waiting_energy_consumption, working_energy_consumption"]

PartGenerator["**part_generator Process**<br/>Feeds raw_input at fixed rate"]

SimulationFlow["**Simulation Flow**<br/>Warmup run then measurement<br/>Sample WIP every 600 seconds<br/>Compute throughput and avg_wip"]

Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize wip<br/>Maximize throughput represented as minimize negative throughput"]

NSGA2Update["**Population Update**<br/>Receive F values from Problem._evaluate<br/>Selection crossover mutation to generate new population"]

ExportCSV["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Iterate result.history<br/>Write generations individuals caps wip throughput to results/moo_simulation_results.csv"]

End["**End**<br/>CSV exported and optimization complete"]

%% Flow connections
Start --> RunNSGA2
RunNSGA2 --> CreateProblem
CreateProblem --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Minimize
Minimize --> ProblemEvaluate
ProblemEvaluate --> MultiprocPool
MultiprocPool --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimCaps --> MachineClass
RunSimCaps --> PartGenerator
RunSimCaps --> SimulationFlow
SimulationFlow --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> Objectives
Objectives --> ProblemEvaluate
ProblemEvaluate --> NSGA2Update
NSGA2Update --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Minimize
Minimize --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End